=== a body that consumes its inputs and raises partway ===
PASS: the body's error is re-raised
PASS: the value under the entry stack is untouched
PASS: the cleanup quotation sees the entry stack, not the body's leftovers
=== a body that succeeds ===
PASS: the body's result is kept
PASS: the cleanup quotation runs over the body's results
=== a cleanup quotation that raises partway ===
PASS: the body's result is all that continues
=== a cleanup quotation that leaves values ===
PASS: the cleanup quotation's values are discarded
